1709	1774	1708	1708	I.	56	" True,--but , with submission , sir , behold these hairs ! I am getting old . Surely , sir , a blot or two of a warm afternoon is not to be severely urged against gray hairs . Old age -- even if it blot the page -- is honorable . With submission , sir , we _ both _ are getting old . "
